## Experience and Lessons
|Case|:**registration**
   - **Error Analysis:** The test expects an error message "Username already exists." when trying to register an existing username, but the application simply remains on the registration page without any feedback.
   - **Guidance:** Modify the registration route to render the registration template again with an error message for existing usernames. Implement appropriate error handling to feedback the user when registration fails.
   - **Error Analysis:** The test failed because the user was not correctly redirected to the login page after a successful registration. The assertion `self.assertIn("Login", self.driver.title)` failed because the title was not as expected.
   |Case|:**login**
   - **Error Analysis:** The login functionality does not redirect to the dashboard after a successful login, resulting in the test finding 'Login' instead of 'Dashboard'.
   - **Guidance:** Ensure that the login process correctly redirects to the dashboard upon successful authentication. Validate the session management to ensure that users successfully logged in are recognized as such throughout the application.
   - **Error Analysis:** This test failed to find the dashboard title after a login attempt. The assertion `self.assertIn("Culture Dashboard", self.driver.title)` failed, indicating that the application did not successfully redirect to the dashboard after a valid login.


